{"sourceUrl":"https://maths.hfut.edu.cn/info/1047/7564.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.979389+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://maths.hfut.edu.cn/info/1047/7564.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进全国高校优秀大学生之间的学术交流，增进学生对合肥工业大学数学学院的了解，合肥工业大学数学学院将于</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>7<span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span>-</span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>在合肥工业大学翡翠湖校区举办</span><span>20</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>活动。申请工作自本通知发布当日开始。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><strong><span><span>申请资格</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、具备研究生推免资格高校或者省属本科院校的大学本科三年级在校</span></span><span>生（</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>届本科毕业生），就读于信息与计算</span></span><span>科学</span><span><span>、数学与应用数学、统计学等相关专业。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、专业成绩排名：</span></span><span>无硬性要求，但需提供成绩排名证明；</span><span><span>或有突出成果、高水平论文或特殊专长者（需在申请表的显著位置注明）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、英语水平良好，通过国家四级考试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>将下列申请材料电子版（扫描件</span></span><span>或照片</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>按顺序整理打包成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，</span></span><span><span>发送到</span></span><span>指定</span><span><span>邮箱</span></span><span><span>908979711</span></span><span>@qq.com<span>，邮件主题：姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校</span><span>+</span><span>专业</span><span>+20</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>夏令营申请，报名截止日期</span></span><span>20</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>。录取的营员在报到时，需携带下列申请材料的纸质版。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>申请材料装订顺序：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1) </span><span><span>合肥工业大学数学学院</span>20</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表（需签字</span></span><span>盖章</span><span><span>）（见附件一）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2) </span><span><span>本科前两年半成绩单（需</span></span><span>加</span><span><span>盖学校教务部门或院系公章）、专业成绩排名证明（需加盖学校教务部门或院系公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3) </span><span><span>专家推荐信</span>1<span>封（见附件二）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4) </span><span><span>身份证、学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5) </span><span><span>大学英语四级成绩单或其他体现英语水平的证明；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6) </span><span><span>获奖证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7) </span><span><span>其他附件材料，包括参与科研项目证明、学术论文等（较厚的出版物等可只复印封面）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、材料审核及营员遴选</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>材料审核和营员遴选工作将于</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>前结束。入选名单将在数学学院网站上公布，并同步电话通知本人，未接到电话通知者即皆未入选，不再另行告知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、日程安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>夏令营活动的日程拟安排如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7月10日15:00-17:00入营报到（合肥工业大学翡翠湖校区翡翠科教楼B座1710）</span></p>\n<p><span>7月11日9:00-11:30 开营仪式、学院与专业介绍</span></p>\n<p><span>7月11日14:00-17:30 学术交流、结营。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、其他说明</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、本次</span></span><span>夏令营学院不收</span><span><span>取任何费用，</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日晚餐和</span><span>11</span><span>日中餐由学院提供</span></span><span>，交通费自理。</span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、合肥工业大学数学学院将为入选营员统一购买在夏令营期间的意外伤害保险。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、营员必须遵守相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动，不得擅自离营。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4<span>、未尽事宜请关注合肥工业大学数学学院网站（</span><span>http://maths.hfut.edu.cn/</span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>咨询电话：杜老师 0551-63831673，咨询时间：8:30-11:30，14:30-17:00（工作日）</span></p>\n<p><span><span>合肥工业大学数学学</span></span><span>院</span></p>\n<p><span>20</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"bf7e90acaac632ea8e20c3eafccd9829924546c0f7cd35c7a37b0ab29aa713e6","textLength":1031,"sourceSha256":"b0f6378eacc38f0ec596b633fe0760ceef7ff6b0ced46e726d802f0dacbce5cb","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件一：申请表.docx","url":"https://maths.hfut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1747959454&wbfileid=17986786"},{"name":"附件二：推荐信.doc","url":"https://maths.hfut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1747959454&wbfileid=17986787"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-79326badb3646e240620","title":"2026年合肥工业大学数学学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.979389+00:00"}
